t before the world was made","where travellers leave a coin for the cave spirits","guarded by a stone door that opens only at midwinter","where a sleeping king and his knights wait for the call","home to gnomes who trade in lost things","where the echoes answer in other voices","a maze of tunnels with a lake at its heart","where a wizard keeps his library out of the rain","where the fairy folk hold their midsummer dances","its walls painted with hunters from a forgotten age","where the wind blows warm from somewhere far below","whose deepest chamber holds a tree that needs no sun","where the stones hum when danger is near"],"lair":["littered with the bones of foolish adventurers","where something sleeps on a bed of gold coins","reeking of smoke, sulphur and old meals","where something counts its stolen sheep","with claw marks gouged into the entrance","where a hoard of stolen bells is piled to the roof","where a very large cooking pot hangs over the fire","whose owner has not been seen in fifty years, or has it?","with a warning sign scratched by the last survivors","where the beast wakes only when it smells gold","guarded by a nest of hissing hatchlings","where the bounty on its owner keeps going up","where the floor is warm from the breath below","its mouth hung with webs as thick as rope","where whatever lives inside grows back stronger every time","whose owner collects shiny things","where the local lord sends his least favourite knights","with a treasure heap that moves when no one is looking","where shepherds lose a lamb every full moon","where the cave floor is scattered with snapped swords","with a smell you can taste from the valley below","where the monster has been asleep for three hundred years"],"crystal":["where amethyst crystals grow taller than a man","lit from within by a soft blue glow","where every footstep rings like a bell","its walls glittering like a starry sky","where the crystals sing when the wind blows","where light bends into rainbows on every wall","whose crystals are said to hold old memories","where the dwarves cut gems for the crowns of kings","where a crystal lake lies perfectly still","with columns of quartz like the pillars of a temple","where the crystals grow back overnight","with a ceiling of hanging glass needles","where wizards come to charge their staffs","whose largest geode could hold a wagon","where the walls shine green in lantern light","with a frozen waterfall of white calcite","where miners once worked by the glow of the stone alone","where the gems change colour with the seasons","whose deepest chamber is too bright to look at","so beautiful that visitors forget to leave","where the crystals hum a single endless note","where you can see your reflection a thousand times"],"sea":["reachable only at low tide","where the sea booms like a drum in a storm","once used by smugglers to hide their cargo","where seals pup on the shingle each autumn","its walls bright with sea anemones","where the spray shoots out of a hole in the cliff","said to be home to a mermaid who sings at dusk","with a secret tunnel up to the old inn","where the wreckers once lit their false lanterns","where the tide comes in faster than you can walk","with a ship's bell found wedged in the rock","where puffins nest in the cliffs above","filled with green light when the sun is low","where the old sea captain hid his last chest","echoing with the cries of the gulls","where the waves have carved a great stone arch","with rock pools full of crabs and starfish","where the fishermen will not set their nets","flooded twice a day and dry as a bone between","where the selkies are said to leave their skins","with a sandy floor that hides more than shells","where the sea breathes in and out like a giant"],"dark":["where the darkness swallows lantern light","with a shaft so deep no one has heard a stone land","where the cavers say you should never go alone","where a cold wind blows up from below","where the first explorers never came back","where strange scratching sounds come from the walls","with a rope still hanging from the last expedition","where the bats leave in their thousands at dusk","its mouth shaped like a grinning skull","where a black river runs with no known end","where the floods come without warning","where your own breathing sounds far too loud","where the local children dare each other to go in","with a passage too narrow for anyone sensible","where the old miners left a warning carved at the entrance","where lights have been seen far below the surface","where every passage seems to lead back to the start","where the silence is the loudest thing you have ever heard","where something keeps moving the cavers' markers","that the locals call the throat of the hill","where candles burn low and blue","whose bottom has never been reached"]}}}